BURSTS on the grid (shunt-only, 960 x 1.083 us, folded on the 20 kHz period, A per slot after the ON edge):
 2S : 1.05 1.47 1.72 1.76 1.74 1.71 1.71 1.71 ...  settled by slot 3 (~3.3 us) to V/R within 1%; fall edge 3 slots.
 USB: 0.56 0.75 0.88 0.97 1.03 1.07 1.09 1.10 1.11 1.12  settled by slot 9-10 (~10 us); OFF window carries a slow recharge tail (0.86 0.45 0.27 0.16 0.10).
 => two floors: amplifier edge ~3 us (both supplies; 2A 6k4/430 + 22 pF should ~halve it; late-window sampling removes the x2), and island-cap charge sharing on the soft rail (USB only; fix = every DRV/bulk cap returns to GND outside the shunt loop). Crest current honest from 15% on 2S, ~30% on USB, on board D.
 USB ladder (2 captures): R_app 5.66 at 10% -> 4.00 at 25% -> 3.69 at 100%. 2S ladder (5 captures): 4.54 at 10%, 3.67 at 15%, 3.56-3.64 from 16% to 100%.
DESIGN (Aaron 2026-09-14): no external CSA (no ADC pin, and 350-400 kHz CSAs settle no faster than the OPA at G15); keep DNP pads for the OPA network; target honest crest from 8% duty on 2A, 3-4% with late-window sampling.
